Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.63,0:01:40.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now then, time to get today's work started.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.08,0:01:45.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it, Zabuton?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.46,0:01:49.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A bee?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.79,0:01:51.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.29,0:01:53.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.13,0:01:54.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Will you eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.13,0:01:58.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So then... you'll keep it as a pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.88,0:02:02.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it might be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.04,0:02:05.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, it won't fight back anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:07.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.79,0:02:12.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.04,0:02:16.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I built a little house for\Nthe bee's nest near the orchard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:20.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They built a big nest inside\Nin about ten days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.25,0:02:22.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The worker bees are all busy\Ntaking care of their jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.54,0:02:25.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, only the queen is that big.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:28.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The worker bees are all normal sized.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.33,0:02:32.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I leave them here like this, I wonder if\Nthey'll make honey that I can harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.08,0:02:35.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The crops in the fields have\Nflowering plants, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.67,0:02:39.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,maybe I should plant a flower garden nearby\Nif I want to be able to harvest honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.54,0:02:41.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Hiraku...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.25,0:02:45.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pardon the intrusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.96,0:02:48.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's been stung before or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.96,0:02:59.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.08,0:03:00.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A reservoir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.33,0:03:02.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or at least it will be, some day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.54,0:03:05.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I planned on drawing water from\Nthe river through a waterway,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:07.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I've been pretty busy\Nwith other stuff lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.96,0:03:09.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.96,0:03:12.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How far have you progressed with\Nthe waterway construction?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.71,0:03:14.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I haven't even\Nprogressed far enough
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.83,0:03:16.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to decide what I'm going to\Nmake it out of yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.63,0:03:20.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's actually quite a bit of distance\Nbetween here and the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.71,0:03:23.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First we need to decide\Nwhat to build it out of, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.46,0:03:27.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've always pictured waterways as\Nthings that you build from stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.50,0:03:32.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hm... I think it would be hard to find\Nstone to work with around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.17,0:03:35.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, should we make it out of wood?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.08,0:03:37.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, we do have a lot of wood here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:42.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But if we have a long waterway, the gaps\Nin the wood will cause a lot of leakage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.29,0:03:44.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.17,0:03:46.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll use this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.58,0:03:52.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I compacting dirt using\Nthe almighty farming tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.71,0:03:55.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's about as hard as concrete.\NI think this will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:57.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Crete?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:58.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.54,0:04:01.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I actually had a mountain of dirt left over\Nfrom digging out the reservoir
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.58,0:04:04.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that I wasn't sure what to do with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.29,0:04:06.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We went right into mass production mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.29,0:04:08.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One! Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.04,0:04:09.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.79,0:04:13.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We built an intake gate for the water\Nat the top of the waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.08,0:04:14.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then we built up the foundation using dirt,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.79,0:04:16.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and placed the parts for\Nthe waterway on top of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.13,0:04:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.29,0:04:20.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A little more this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:26.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I let the elves handle\Nthe basic foundation work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.08,0:04:27.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.21,0:04:28.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:32.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I focused on sealing the seams and\Nstrengthening the foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.54,0:04:35.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks to all of their hard work,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.71,0:04:38.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the construction moved along a lot faster\Nthan I was initially expecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.67,0:04:49.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now we finally won't have to climb\Nin and out of the well for water every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.33,0:04:52.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. This should make watering\Nthe crops much easier as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:56.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, look what's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:04:58.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I haven't been able to get\Nmy hands on them until now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.58,0:05:01.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but now that we have access to the river,\NI'll finally be able to eat fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.83,0:05:04.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now I just need to decide\Nhow I'm going to prepare them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.13,0:05:08.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know, the rabbits in this forest\Nmay be really vicious,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.33,0:05:10.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but the fish here seem to be pretty normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.46,0:05:12.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm really glad that they're so easy to catch-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.88,0:05:13.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.08,0:05:22.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aren't those fish...\Nfrom The Forest of Death?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.83,0:05:25.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Those are the really vicious ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.75,0:05:28.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's safe to eat those...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.58,0:05:34.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here, it's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.38,0:05:35.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.75,0:05:37.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should get to eat first\Nsince you made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.38,0:05:40.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah, she's right.\NYou're the one who made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.17,0:05:41.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.58,0:05:43.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay then, I'll help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.04,0:05:50.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks and tastes just like salmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.63,0:05:51.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like ham and what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.83,0:05:53.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, forget what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:56.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here. Don't be shy, eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:06.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.79,0:06:08.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,d-delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.21,0:06:15.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, um... would you all like to try some?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.63,0:06:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They all loved it so I went through\Neverything I made that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.29,0:06:20.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But after that we caught a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.83,0:06:23.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and preserved them with salt\Nso we could put them away in storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.96,0:06:29.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I decided to try tilling with the hoe\Nwhile thinking about rice plants,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.67,0:06:31.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and rice plants popped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:34.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that they could\Ngrow in normal soil,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:37.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but now that we have\Nthe waterways built here...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:40.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're building a rice paddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.33,0:06:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you say a paddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.46,0:07:03.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks just like a normal crop field...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:04.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm just getting started here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:17.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you building a pond here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.33,0:07:19.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:21.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're going to keep fish here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:23.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess that's how it looks now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.83,0:07:27.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, now I'm going to need you all\Nto help me with this next part.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.00,0:07:29.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.83,0:07:35.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's all slimy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.00,0:07:41.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay everyone, I'm going to\Nhand these seedlings out
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.88,0:07:43.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and then we're going to plant them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:07:58.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The girls were a little nervous at first,\Nbut they got the hang of it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.79,0:08:01.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The rice planting went off without a hitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.42,0:08:06.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I put Zabuton's children in charge of\Nkeeping pests out of the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:10.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if it was thanks to the water\Nor the almighty farming tool,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.46,0:08:15.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but the rice plants grew much faster\Nthan I was expecting them to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.25,0:08:18.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And now, it's time to harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.13,0:08:21.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had Lea and the girls\Nhelp me with this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.42,0:08:26.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And thanks to them,\Nit was done in the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:32.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.25,0:08:34.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,what exactly are we doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.13,0:08:36.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're drying them to get all the moisture out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.17,0:08:41.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know about all kinds of stuff, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.63,0:08:43.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, this is just something\NI happened to have picked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.29,0:08:45.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:49.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I happened to watch an idol\Ndoing this on TV one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:54.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, these are the crops\Nyou grew in that paddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.67,0:08:57.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.17,0:08:58.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're going to thresh them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.54,0:08:59.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thresh them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.71,0:09:00.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.79,0:09:02.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.88,0:09:08.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure the old thresher I saw\Nin a museum looked something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.13,0:09:14.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, that's the gist of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.50,0:09:19.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next, we put them through a sieve to get rid\Nof any remaining leaves or plant matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.21,0:09:22.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then we use a mortar to\Nremove the husk from the rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:26.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And now, we use a pestle\Nto polish the rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:30.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This stuff takes a lot of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.71,0:09:31.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.92,0:09:35.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can you not eat it\Nif you don't do all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:40.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you finally done?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.38,0:09:41.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.50,0:09:43.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That means we can eat it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.63,0:09:45.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.54,0:09:50.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:51.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm cooking the rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.38,0:09:55.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I remember right, the way to\Ncook rice in a kettle like this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:09:58.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First you start it nice and slow,\Nthen later the sparks fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.29,0:10:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once it starts rising up,\Ncut the heat down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.29,0:10:03.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Add a fistful of straw to the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.63,0:10:05.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then no matter what happens,\Ndon't lift the lid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.79,0:10:07.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What kind of spell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.58,0:10:10.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who knows? I've never heard it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.38,0:10:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.67,0:10:14.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could you use your magic\Nto light the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.79,0:10:16.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'd be happy to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's finally time for the great sage\NLord Lulucy to show what she can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.13,0:10:24.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll blast you to smithereens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.50,0:10:27.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, it's supposed to be nice\Nand slow so I need a low flame!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.25,0:10:30.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on. How boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.00,0:10:34.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of food\Nhe's making this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.25,0:10:38.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what he's making,\Nbut I'm curious to see what the spell did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.54,0:10:44.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It came out great!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.13,0:10:45.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's done now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:46.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.58,0:10:59.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is what he spent all that time making?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.75,0:11:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. If you're going to try rice,\Nthen I think rice balls are the way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.29,0:11:06.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:09.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,F-fine, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.25,0:11:22.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.79,0:11:24.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.13,0:11:25.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.42,0:11:27.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,this is the fish from the other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.63,0:11:29.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. The saltiness goes well with the rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.21,0:11:34.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now I feel like all that hard work\Nwas worth it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.79,0:11:39.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is my happiest moment as a farmer yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.13,0:11:45.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are they good?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.63,0:11:49.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,W-well, it looks like they're a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.21,0:11:51.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to work harder\Nand make more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.67,0:11:54.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next time I think I'll do a different filling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.08,0:12:05.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's stop here for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.08,0:12:06.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.50,0:12:35.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they can all\Nclean themselves off with magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.63,0:12:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's times like this I really wish\NI had a bath I could hop in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.38,0:12:42.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I did build a waterway,\Nso I'll give it a shot and build one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.83,0:12:48.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.92,0:12:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.00,0:12:51.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:54.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a place where you wash\Nyour body with warm water.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.54,0:12:57.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A furnace to heat up the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:12:59.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A tub to hold the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.71,0:13:01.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And a place to wash your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.79,0:13:04.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to make a changing room, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.88,0:13:08.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can't we just wash ourselves\Nin a river or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.21,0:13:10.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't it too cold for that during the winter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.92,0:13:12.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:14.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just trust me! Baths are great!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:16.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to build one, no matter what it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:17.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's good for your circulation\Nand can improve your health!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.79,0:13:19.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,W-we'll help you build it.\N{\rSubtitle}It's good for your circulation{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}and can improve your health!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.21,0:13:23.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And so, construction began right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.96,0:13:26.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The furnace was made from blocks of dirt\Ncompacted with the hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.54,0:13:29.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We fed it water we brought in\Nfrom the waterway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.25,0:13:33.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And the most important part\Nof the bath, the tub itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.88,0:13:35.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to make it as big as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.42,0:13:38.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We made stools to sit on in the washing area.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:40.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everything seems to be going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.33,0:13:43.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.54,0:13:45.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm just now noticing this...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.04,0:13:49.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pulling water from the river is fine and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.46,0:13:54.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But is it okay to put our wastewater from\Nthe bath and stuff back into the river?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.17,0:13:57.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If that's what you're worried about,\Nwe can just use slimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.29,0:13:58.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Slimes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.46,0:13:59.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:02.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They eat waste products and\Ndead organic matter and purify it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.42,0:14:04.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're nature's cleaning machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:07.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aren't those weak looking monsters\Nthat are actually really dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.79,0:14:12.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and end up being the number one\Ncause of death in new adventurers?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.96,0:14:14.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.04,0:14:17.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll go catch some.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.63,0:14:18.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.63,0:14:23.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She grabbed them from\Nnear the starting village.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:27.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Will you eat this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.71,0:14:30.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.04,0:14:37.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I built a purification pool for the slimes\Nin the waste-waterway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.58,0:14:41.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we put slimes in the toilet,\Nthey'll clean everything there for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.75,0:14:43.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm glad they'll do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:46.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I don't know if I have the courage to\Ndo my business right above a slime's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:50.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And just like that,\Nthe wastewater problem was solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.04,0:14:54.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now I just need to grab some firewood,\Nand the bath will be ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.71,0:14:58.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A mushroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.75,0:15:02.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've actually been too afraid to eat\Nany of the mushrooms in this forest
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.21,0:15:05.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,because I don't know which ones\Nmight be poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.17,0:15:07.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You made the right choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.96,0:15:10.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're really hard to tell apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.92,0:15:13.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're pretty much edible if you cook them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.58,0:15:17.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you'd like me to, I'd be happy to\Neliminate them all for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.21,0:15:19.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Is that what we're talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.71,0:15:21.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The residents all had different opinions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:24.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.17,0:15:25.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shiitake, shiitake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.54,0:15:27.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted to hurry up and grow\Nall the mushrooms I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.38,0:15:28.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shimeji, shimeji.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.42,0:15:30.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if this was right way to do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.71,0:15:32.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Eringi, maitake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:33.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bunashimeji, shimeji.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.63,0:15:35.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I completely forgot about the bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.46,0:15:40.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now I'm going to teach you all\Nhow to use the bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:42.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First, you take your clothes off\Nin the changing room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.71,0:15:45.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, before you actually get into the tub,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:48.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you first need to rinse and lightly wash\Nyourself off in the washing area using a...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.38,0:15:49.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.96,0:15:53.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It would be very helpful if you could\Nshow us how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.71,0:15:56.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-you want me to show you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:16:02.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, first you get undressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.58,0:16:07.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then you rinse yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.21,0:16:08.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then you wash yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.63,0:16:12.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Finally, you get into the bath and...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.96,0:16:16.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.08,0:16:20.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can really feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.71,0:16:23.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How long has it been since I've\Ntaken a bath like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.46,0:16:26.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I remember I wasn't allowed to get\Ninto a bath while I was hospitalized.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:29.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Almost zoned out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.29,0:16:30.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So anyways, that's how you enjoy the bath...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.88,0:16:31.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.29,0:16:38.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's nice to be able to relax and\Nwash ourselves like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.96,0:16:40.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,U-um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.29,0:16:43.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, it's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.71,0:16:46.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll get out first, so you all take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.42,0:16:47.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:49.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can't we all just bathe together?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.63,0:16:50.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.92,0:16:53.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This way we don't need to\Nheat up the water again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.88,0:16:55.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.25,0:16:57.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're right about that, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.21,0:17:00.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm too embarrassed to relax right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.79,0:17:05.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In the end, there wasn't much time\Nfor me to relax while I was in the bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:08.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I should have built a separate men's bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.75,0:17:11.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that just be a private bath for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.17,0:17:13.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No fair! You can't have one all for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.33,0:17:15.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that what you guys think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.21,0:17:22.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks like it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.13,0:17:25.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll make a mushroom hot pot tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.54,0:17:31.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The dogs found five new elves\Nand brought them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:32.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Lafa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.25,0:17:33.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Lasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.33,0:17:34.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Lalasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.46,0:17:35.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Lalu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.58,0:17:36.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Lami.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.50,0:17:37.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're all La.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.96,0:17:40.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, do you mean our names?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.63,0:17:42.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The reason our names are similar is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.13,0:17:43.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're all related, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.79,0:17:46.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm surprised that you knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.92,0:17:49.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do they all want to live here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:52.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. They used to live in\Nthe same village as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.58,0:17:56.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Since we left, we've been living our lives as\Nwanderers looking for somewhere to settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.00,0:17:58.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's been 200 years since our groups\Nhave seen each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.21,0:17:59.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,200!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.21,0:18:01.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You must have had a really rough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.25,0:18:03.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.75,0:18:06.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you'd like, you can live here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.75,0:18:08.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.88,0:18:12.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's start building a house\Nfor you all to live in right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.21,0:18:13.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.29,0:18:16.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why don't we take this opportunity to make\Nsome improvements to Hiraku's house as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.38,0:18:19.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, there are more people living in it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:21.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess it is getting kind of cramped in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:24.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll help you with the work!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.46,0:18:26.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks. That'll be a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.83,0:18:30.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay everyone, let's get started on our work!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.50,0:18:31.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.00,0:18:37.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And to ensure the revival of our race,\Nlet's also start making children!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.25,0:18:38.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.75,0:18:43.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how they\Nintend to make children,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.25,0:18:45.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but it's nice to see they're so optimistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.00,0:18:47.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's start now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.75,0:18:49.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's time to make houses!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.29,0:18:51.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.63,0:18:52.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Farming Life...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.63,0:18:53.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,in Another...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.75,0:18:54.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,World.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.92,0:18:59.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...let's also start making children!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.00,0:19:00.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.71,0:19:05.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It appears the number of females in\Nmy master's pack has increased again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.54,0:19:08.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My name is Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.38,0:19:12.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Before I met my master,\NI didn't have a name to call my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.79,0:19:18.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Starting from the moment I was born;\NI spent my whole life in this forest alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:23.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never lost a single fight to another male.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.38,0:19:27.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I planned on living my whole life\Ndoing whatever I pleased
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.08,0:19:28.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and hunting when I needed to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.38,0:19:30.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But one day...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.04,0:19:32.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I met a female.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.17,0:19:37.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't stand a chance against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.17,0:19:42.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After my complete loss to that female,\Nwe began to travel together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.79,0:19:47.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sometime after that,\Nher belly started to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.96,0:19:50.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be long before\Nshe gave birth to our children.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.25,0:19:54.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are animals in this forest\Nwho lead around packs of their little ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:58.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When I thought about how that\Nwould become my life one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.88,0:20:00.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it didn't seem so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.00,0:20:02.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.13,0:20:06.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our luck took a turn for the worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.04,0:20:11.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We ran into the one they call the\Ngrappler bear, the king of this forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.46,0:20:15.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know if he decided on a whim\Nto spare us, or if he was just full,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:17.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but he didn't eat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.67,0:20:21.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We were still gravely injured,\Nand as a result we couldn't hunt for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.92,0:20:24.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'd become so weak that our\Nformer prey had driven us away,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.83,0:20:27.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and before we knew it, we found ourselves\Nat the center of this forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.75,0:20:30.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,at a place where even the grappler bear\Ndoesn't dare to tread.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.79,0:20:36.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What we found there was a human male.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.25,0:20:40.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I always thought the people living in\Nthe forest kept themselves hidden
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.04,0:20:43.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and never stayed in one place for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.21,0:20:46.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How could someone so weak looking\Nsurvive here by himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.92,0:20:48.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Come on.\N{\rSubtitle}How could someone so weak looking{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}survive here by himself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.33,0:20:49.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How could someone so weak looking\Nsurvive here by himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.92,0:20:51.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.13,0:20:54.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I felt a limitless power\Ncoming from that tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.79,0:20:59.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We thought our lives were over,\Nand we'd already made our peace with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.83,0:21:04.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But he shared his prey with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:05.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He took care of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.71,0:21:08.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is the meat of a gate boar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.33,0:21:12.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed that he was able\Nto hunt such a great beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.33,0:21:16.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We don't have any desire to fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:20.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The female and I have decided that\Nthis male will be our master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.42,0:21:25.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our master gave us names\Nas well as a home to live in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.46,0:21:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The meat that he bleeds and cleans for us\Nand the vegetables he cooks are delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.54,0:21:33.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But the most delicious part of\Nan animal is the innards.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.42,0:21:35.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Throwing that away is a terrible waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.67,0:21:40.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Before long, our children grew up\Nand our family got bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.46,0:21:45.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our master also become the leader\Nof a large pack of his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.25,0:21:48.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looking at all the females he leads,\NI can't help but think that he must be
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.88,0:21:52.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,more than just a weak human\Nas I'd once thought he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.29,0:21:55.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My only concern now is,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.92,0:21:58.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,our master doesn't seem to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.54,0:22:04.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's unaware that we're the terrifying\Nmonsters known as the inferno wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.38,0:22:06.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.71,0:22:12.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm just thankful\Nthat my good fortune...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.96,0:22:14.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,led me here to him.
